  (text "Battery power: single USB-C VBUS (main J20 -> J1 pin19) -> BQ25896 (charge 2500mAh LiPo + power-path VSYS). VSYS -> TPS63020 buck-boost +3V3, TPS61230A boost +5V. MAX17048 fuel gauge + DW01/FS8205 protection. +5V/+3V3 feed both boards over J1. IC pinouts + passive values are FIRST-PASS placeholders - VERIFY vs datasheets." (at 40 210 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid de244792-c228-4b21-865f-fb4599c8b248))
